<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#f4f5ef">
  <meta name="description" content="The portfolio of Mohammed Rizwan, a Java developer building thoughtful software.">
  <title>Mohammed Rizwan — Developer</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      color-scheme: light;
      --paper: #f4f5ef;
      --ink: #202720;
      --muted: #70776f;
      --line: #d8dbd1;
      --green: #c9f25c;
      --orange: #ee7047;
      --mono: "DM Mono", monospace;
      --sans: "Manrope", sans-serif;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--paper);
      color: var(--ink);
      font-family: var(--sans);
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }
    a { color: inherit; }
    .wrap { width: min(1160px, calc(100% - 64px)); margin-inline: auto; }
    .topbar {
      height: 76px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }
    .wordmark { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; text-decoration: none; }
    .wordmark span { color: var(--orange); }
    nav { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 32px; }
    nav a, .availability {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 11px;
      text-decoration: none;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    nav a { color: var(--muted); transition: color 160ms ease; }
    nav a:hover { color: var(--ink); }
    .availability { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; color: var(--muted); }
    .availability::before {
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #72a84b;
      content: "";
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgb(114 168 75 / 16%);
    }
    .hero {
      min-height: 600px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 0.86fr;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 64px;
      padding-block: 72px 80px;
    }
    .eyebrow, .section-label {
      font: 11px var(--mono);
      letter-spacing: 0;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .eyebrow { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; color: var(--muted); }
    .eyebrow::before { width: 25px; height: 2px; background: var(--orange); content: ""; }
    h1 {
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: 23px 0 20px;
      font-size: clamp(54px, 7.5vw, 100px);
      line-height: 0.98;
      letter-spacing: -5px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    h1 span { color: var(--orange); }
    .intro { max-width: 470px; margin: 0; color: #5b625a; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; }
    .hero-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 25px; margin-top: 34px; }
    .button {
      min-height: 48px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 0 19px;
      background: var(--ink);
      color: white;
      font: 11px var(--mono);
      text-decoration: none;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      transition: background 160ms ease, transform 160ms ease;
    }
    .button:hover { background: #3d4d3d; transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .text-link { font: 11px var(--mono); text-decoration-color: var(--orange); text-underline-offset: 5px; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .hero-visual {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 405px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: #263930;
    }
    .hero-visual img { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
    .visual-note {
      position: absolute;
      right: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      left: 0;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 16px 18px;
      background: rgb(25 35 29 / 84%);
      color: white;
      font: 10px var(--mono);
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .visual-note span:last-child { color: var(--green); }
    .ticker { overflow: hidden; background: var(--green); }
    .ticker-inner {
      min-height: 54px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 20px;
      font: 11px var(--mono);
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .ticker-inner span::before { margin-right: 10px; color: var(--orange); content: "+"; }
    .section { padding-block: 105px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .section-head { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr; gap: 28px; margin-bottom: 48px; }
    .section-label { margin-top: 13px; color: var(--muted); }
    h2 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(34px, 4.5vw, 56px); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -2px; }
    .about-copy { max-width: 700px; margin: 24px 0 0 auto; color: #5b625a; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.9; }
    .focus-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); margin-top: 43px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .focus-item { padding: 20px 18px 0 0; }
    .focus-item + .focus-item { padding-left: 22px; border-left: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .focus-item strong { display: block; font-size: 14px; }
    .focus-item span { display: block; margin-top: 8px; color: var(--muted); font: 10px var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; }
    .work { background: #e9ebe3; }
    .work-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px; }
    .project {
      min-height: 270px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 25px;
      border: 1px solid #d1d5ca;
      transition: border-color 160ms ease, transform 160ms ease;
    }
    .project:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); border-color: var(--ink); }
    .project-meta { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; color: var(--muted); font: 10px var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; }
    .project-index { color: var(--orange); }
    .project h3 { margin: 0 0 9px; font-size: 25px; letter-spacing: -1px; }
    .project p { max-width: 390px; margin: 0; color: #626960; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7; }
    .project-tag { display: inline-block; margin-top: 17px; padding: 7px 9px; background: var(--green); font: 9px var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; }
    .contact { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; align-items: end; gap: 32px; }
    .contact h2 { max-width: 650px; }
    .contact p { margin: 18px 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; }
    footer { min-height: 78px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; color: var(--muted); font: 10px var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; }
    footer a { color: var(--ink); text-decoration-color: var(--orange); text-underline-offset: 4px; }

    @media (max-width: 760px) {
      .wrap { width: min(100% - 40px, 560px); }
      .topbar { height: auto; min-height: 68px; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; padding-block: 13px; }
      nav { order: 3; width: 100%; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; padding-top: 9px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
      nav a { font-size: 10px; }
      .availability { font-size: 9px; }
      .hero { min-height: auto; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 38px; padding-block: 66px 48px; }
      h1 { max-width: 560px; font-size: clamp(58px, 13vw, 82px); letter-spacing: -3px; }
      .hero-visual { min-height: 310px; }
      .ticker-inner { justify-content: flex-start; overflow-x: auto; }
      .ticker-inner span { flex: 0 0 auto; }
      .section { padding-block: 72px; }
      .section-head { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 32px; }
      .section-label { margin-top: 0; }
      .about-copy { margin-top: 20px; }
      .focus-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .focus-item, .focus-item + .focus-item { padding: 16px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); border-left: 0; }
      .focus-item:first-child { padding-top: 20px; }
      .work-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 12px; }
      .project { min-height: 235px; padding: 20px; }
      .contact { grid-template-columns: 1fr; align-items: start; }
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *, *::before, *::after { scroll-behavior: auto !important; transition-duration: 0.01ms !important; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="wrap topbar">
    <a class="wordmark" href="#home" aria-label="Mohammed Rizwan, home">MR<span>.</span></a>
    <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#work">Projects</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="availability">Open to opportunities</div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="wrap hero" id="home">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Developer portfolio · 2026</div>
        <h1>Mohammed<br>Rizwan<span>.</span></h1>
        <p class="intro">Java developer in progress, building a strong foundation one thoughtful project at a time.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button" href="#work">Explore my work</a>
          <a class="text-link" href="#contact">Get in touch</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518770660439-4636190af475?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1100&q=85" alt="Close-up of a circuit board and its electronic components">
        <div class="visual-note"><span>Curiosity → code</span><span>Currently learning Java</span></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="ticker" aria-label="Areas of focus">
      <div class="wrap ticker-inner">
        <span>Java</span><span>Problem solving</span><span>Learning by building</span><span>Clean code</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="wrap section" id="about">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="section-label">01 / A little about me</div>
        <div>
          <h2>Good software starts with a curious mind.</h2>
          <p class="about-copy">I’m developing my skills in Java and enjoy the process of turning a simple idea into something that works. This portfolio is where I’ll share what I’m learning and the projects I build along the way.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="focus-row">
        <div class="focus-item"><strong>Java fundamentals</strong><span>Learning focus</span></div>
        <div class="focus-item"><strong>Breaking problems down</strong><span>How I work</span></div>
        <div class="focus-item"><strong>Small steps, real progress</strong><span>What matters</span></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="work" id="work">
      <div class="wrap section">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div class="section-label">02 / Selected work</div>
          <div>
            <h2>Projects, built as I learn.</h2>
            <p class="about-copy">A first step, with more to come.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="work-grid">
          <article class="project">
            <div class="project-meta"><span class="project-index">Project 01</span><span>Java · 2026</span></div>
            <div>
              <h3>Hello, World!</h3>
              <p>A small Java program that prints a first message to the console. Every project starts somewhere.</p>
              <span class="project-tag">First Java program</span>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="project">
            <div class="project-meta"><span class="project-index">Up next</span><span>In progress</span></div>
            <div>
              <h3>More soon.</h3>
              <p>I’m working on new projects and will add them here as they’re ready.</p>
              <span class="project-tag">Currently learning</span>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="wrap section contact" id="contact">
      <div>
        <div class="section-label">03 / Say hello</div>
        <h2>Have an idea or an opportunity?</h2>
        <p>I’d be glad to hear from you.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="button" href="mailto:" aria-label="Send Mohammed Rizwan an email">Start a conversation</a>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="wrap">
    <span>© 2026 Mohammed Rizwan</span>
    <a href="#home">Back to top ↑</a>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
